  "rationale": "The workflow is a single-job release notification (release published / workflow_dispatch) that dumps GitHub context and posts a Slack message. It installs no dependencies, has no matrix, no schedules, no tests, and the repository CI history shows no completed runs, so no measurable baseline exists. Evaluated patterns do not apply: P-LIT-GHA-CACHE has no dependency installation to cache; P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT requires representative successful-duration history which is absent; P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE is contraindicated for release/deployment-style work and releases are distinct events rather than branch/PR revisions; matrix fail-fast, schedule suppression, test selection/prioritization, and Bazel patterns are irrelevant to this notification-only job. No supported optimization preserves coverage while fitting this workflow.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT", "P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE"]
}
